|cffe6cc80Character notes|r

• Shared guild notes: turn on |cffffffffShare guild notes|r and your notes go to guildmates with the addon (tick |cffffffffPrivate|r to keep one to yourself). Guild notes show with their author in the notes window, tooltips and the Looking For Group window, count toward group warnings, and are passed along to guildmates who weren't online at the same time.
