|cffe6cc80Loadouts|r

• Edit a saved loadout: write macros (icon, text with a 255 counter, character or account), insert helpers and spells, or add a ready-made macro (mouseover cast, focus, cast sequence, trinket and cast, stop casting, start attack, pet).
